/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様のおかげで毎日楽しい熱いライブが出来てます〜充実でぇすっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの団扇やタオルを見つけたり、声援が聞こえたり......本当に幸福者だなぁ......って思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前も台風すごくてメンバーと今日は3、4人しかいないよ......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってて......でも足元の悪いなから会場いっぱいにみなさんが来てくださって本当に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/maaya.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まあやは日常会話に四字熟語？ことわざ？を入れるのにハマってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜例えば〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか忘れちゃったんだけど、\nゆったんとろってぃーと話してて、\nなんかが凄い痛くて、\nまあやが例えで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『注射したときぐらい痛かった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうり\n『えっ私注射わりとすきなんだけど......』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『えっ！？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー\n『まひろもやでっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『！！！？？？。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世の中ヨリドリミドリなんだね......』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていったらろってぃーも難しい言葉使おうとしてきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ\n『そりゃ八方美人やなっ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうり\n『それ使い方違うでしょ(゜o゜)＼(-_-)笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『まぁ世の中十人十色じゃけぇ仕方ないよ......(  ＾∀＾)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言う感じの話をしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も難しい言葉たくさん使ってみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/maaya2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとの広島出身コンビの月刊エンタメ見てくださいましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/08/2848332